Consistency means: same product truth; same approved promise; same brand identity;
coordinated visual and verbal recognition; channel-appropriate execution; no conflicting offer
or instruction. It does not require one identical asset everywhere.

Brand health may include: aided and unaided awareness; correct pronunciation/name
understanding; recognition; associations; consideration; trust; preference; message consistency;
recommendation; reputation themes. Brand measurement should not be reduced to follower count.

