**MRP Governance — MRP must align with:** exact SKU and pack; applicable legal requirements;
channel architecture; customer value; printed or labelled pack information; price list;
listing; invoice and system records; promotional governance.

> **Sales Rule** — A price change is a cross-system change. It must not be updated in one
> listing or sheet while the pack, partner records, and other channels remain inconsistent.

